    "bbox": [
      175.05,
      204.17,
      388.76,
      215.51
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE MARRIAGE REGISTRATION ORDINANCE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      229.37,
      401.9,
      253.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      267.17,
      401.93,
      291.11
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Marriage Registration(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.97,
      401.88,
      354.11
    ],
    "text": "2.The long title of the Marriage Registration OrdinanceNo. 19 of 1907 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is amended to remove the words \u201cOTHERTHAN THE MARRIAGES OF MUSLIMS AND\u201d therein.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      367.97,
      401.91,
      417.11
    ],
    "text": "3.In the Section 64 substitute the interpretation of\u201cmarriage\u201d with the following :- \u201cmarriage\u201d means, \u201canymarriage contracted under this ordinance between a manand a woman who have reached the age of 18 and above\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      443.57,
      401.9,
      467.51
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      268.63,
      446.13,
      277.7
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      306.43,
      451.29,
      353.9
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof the longtitle of theprincipalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      445.51,
      455.86,
      483.38
    ],
    "text": "Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      408.57,
      367.99,
      455.02,
      434.66
    ],
    "text": "Substitute theinterpretationof \u201cmarriage\u201din theSection 64 ofthe principalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
